        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Hi Sydney,</div><div><br></div><div>I hope you're doing well.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for informing us. I'm Sara, and I'm here to help you with this matter.</div><div><br></div><div>We've temporarily adjusted your license on our end to ensure your data remains intact for study #4065. Please be aware that this is a temporary workaround, and we cannot keep it pending indefinitely, as it goes against our policy.</div><div><br></div><div>Please let me know if you need anything else.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Sara</div><div>\n<br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, October 3, 2024 at 8:56:13 PM, Sydney Fortner wrote:<br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>Hi Hanna,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>I got a notification that all of our pilot data will be removed within 3 days. We are currently looking into a license with Avicenna, and will need our pilot data and current activities from the last few weeks to conduct future analyses.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Can we stop the deletion from happening? We are currently in contact with Amin regarding our license.<br>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Best,<br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Sydney Fortner<div>LEAP Neuro Lab Manager</div>\n<div> </div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div><br><br>",
